sequenceDiagram
    actor Human
    participant Captain
    participant Server as Captain server
    participant Crew

    Human->>Captain: delegate work
    Captain->>Server: GET /health
    Captain->>Crew: launch configured backend
    Crew->>Server: POST /hook/{persona}/SessionStart
    loop work
        Crew->>Server: POST /hook/{persona}/{event}
        opt permission required
            Crew->>Server: PreToolUse hook blocks
            Human->>Server: POST /resolve/{id}
            Server-->>Crew: allow or deny
        end
    end
    Crew->>Server: POST /hook/{persona}/SessionEnd
    Crew-->>Captain: result
